 "description": "Built in 1900, this lovely mid-terrace property would make an excellent family home or exciting First Time Buyer opportunity. Well cared for and recently refurbished, it is presented in move-in ready condition.\n\nThe ground floor opens into a hallway, with a front reception to your left and opens into the second reception room with fireplace and kitchen access. The stairs are situated in a private adjoining hall, with a separate door between the two reception rooms. The rear garden is accessed via the kitchen, with a full bathroom suite (shower over bath) to the rear.\n\nThe first floor offers two large double bedrooms. The rear bedroom enjoys garden views, while the front bedroom benefits from ample built-in storage. The second floor provides a private hallway leading to a further bathroom with walk-in shower, built-in storage with boiler access, and a third large double bedroom with Velux window.\n\nThe property has most recently been successfully let as a family home and was previously a licensed HMO. Investors should make their own enquiries regarding current registration and planning requirements for HMO use. The property is fitted with self-closing fire doors, thumb locks, in-date fire escape signage and detectors.",
